spoint editor body-type switching (static/dynamic/kinematic) ACTUALLY-changes fix (gm-skill, 2026-06-11, branch dna-quality-fixes). User: make sure switching objects between physics types in the editor actually changes them. ROOT CAUSE: AppRuntime.changeBodyType (src/apps/AppRuntime.js) dropped the physics body and set _bodyActive=false expecting _tickPhysicsLOD (src/apps/AppRuntimePhysics.js:30) to rebuild it - but that LOD pass `if (!e._bodyDef) continue` (line 51) SKIPS any entity without a _bodyDef, and rebuilds an existing one from its FROZEN _bodyDef.motionType (line 62) which changeBodyType never updated. So the switch was a server-side NO-OP: editor-placed primitives (PLACE_APP box-static/box-dynamic -> spawnEntity, NO app, NO _bodyDef) never got a body, and app-built bodies rebuilt as the SAME type. Also the build gate is `inRange && e._bodyActive===false` (line 60) but a never-had-a-body primitive has _bodyActive===undefined so it would never fire. FIX: changeBodyType now, for a non-static target, updates existing _bodyDef.motionType+opts.linearCast OR synthesizes a fallback box _bodyDef (params = scale*0.5 half-extents, matching AppPhysics.fallbackBox), sets _bodyActive=false unconditionally, clears _activeDynamicIds/_sleeping/_suspended, and nulls _lodIds to refresh the LOD id-cache. The inspector->server WIRING was already intact (EditorInspector.js:53 segmented static/dynamic/kinematic onChange -> EditorShell.js:272 -> app.js:333 onEditorChange -> {bodyType} -> editor.sendEditorUpdate -> MSG.EDITOR_UPDATE -> EditorHandlers.js:111 appRuntime.changeBodyType). WITNESS (gold-standard behavioral, live :8090 via __app.editorAPI.placeApp + .update): a box placed static HELD at y=3.98 for 1s, then FELL 10.89m the instant switched to dynamic. 5 unit tests src/apps/AppRuntime.changeBodyType.test.js (122 suite pass). CAVEAT: __app.editorAPI.placeApp('box-dynamic',...) direct-spawn flaked in the headless harness (box-static spawned fine); switch-the-type-after-place is the reliable witness path. _physicsLODRadius (config physicsRadius) must be >0 and a player in range for the LOD pass to build the body at all.